A Linux-based network diagnostics and automation toolkit written in Python.

## Planned Features

- [ ] Interface Detection
- [ ] IP / Subnet Detection
- [ ] Default Gateway Detection
- [ ] DNS Diagnostics
- [ ] Ping Test
- [ ] Packet Loss Test
- [ ] LAN Discovery
- [ ] Wi-Fi Diagnostics
- [ ] iPerf3 Integration
- [ ] Network Report Generator

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Linux
- iproute2
- nmap
- iPerf3
